{"parse": {"title": "Currencies", "pageid": 172, "revid": 44600, "text": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><div class=\"tabber wds-tabber\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper with-bottom-border\"><ul class=\"wds-tabs\"><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\" data-hash=\"Main_Currencies\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Main Currencies</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Event_Currencies\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Event Currencies</a></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><p>There are currently <b>three</b> main currencies, that being <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" /></a></span> <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\"> Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\"> Gems</span></span></strong>, <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gold\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gold.png\" data-image-key=\"Gold.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/10/Gold.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20220824202442\" /></a></span> <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span class=\"Tsh(Game) C(Gold) game-font-face\"> Gold</span></strong> and <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Trophies\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Trophies.png\" data-image-key=\"Trophies.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/6/6b/Trophies.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20230130150309\" /></a></span> <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span class=\"Tsh(Game) C(Trophies) game-font-face\"> Trophies</span></strong>. They are used to purchase a variety of things in the game.\n</p>\n<div class=\"tabber wds-tabber\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper with-bottom-border\"><ul class=\"wds-tabs\"><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\" data-hash=\"Gems\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Gems</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Gold\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Gold</a></div></li><li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\" data-hash=\"Trophies\"><div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\"><a href=\"#\">Trophies</a></div></li></ul></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><div style=\"background: linear-gradient(0deg, #304ef2 0%, #0000701f 2%, #00007017 100%, transparent );padding: 4px 7px 12px;border-radius:5px\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gems_Gems\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\"> Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\"> Gems</span></span></strong></span></h2>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gems\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/d5/Gems.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20250109022450\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Gems.png\" data-image-key=\"Gems.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Gems) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\"> Gems<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\"> Gems</span></span></strong> are one of the most important currencies in Anime Adventures, as they are used to obtain powerful Units. They can be obtained by completing <a href=\"/wiki/Quests\" title=\"Quests\">Quests</a>, Story Mode missions, Doing Raids, waves in Infinite Modes, redeeming <a href=\"/wiki/Codes\" title=\"Codes\">Codes</a>, staying in the <a href=\"/wiki/Time_Machine\" title=\"Time Machine\">Time Machine</a>, logging in daily, <a href=\"/wiki/Events\" title=\"Events\">events</a>, Completing <span class=\"new\" title=\"Infinity Castle (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvSW5maW5pdHlfQ2FzdGxlP2FjdGlvbj1lZGl0JnJlZGxpbms9MQ==\">Infinity Castle</span> rooms and buying them with <span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/4/41/Robux.png/revision/latest?cb=20221030053917\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Robux\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/4/41/Robux.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20221030053917\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"26\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Robux.png\" data-image-key=\"Robux.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></a></span> <span class=\"game-font-face\" style=\"position: relative; background: linear-gradient(#F7F7FE, #939397); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\"> Robux</span>.\n</p>\n</div><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><div style=\"background: linear-gradient(0deg, #ffc72c 0%, #ffc72c2e 2%, #ffc72c12 100%, transparent );padding: 4px 7px 12px;border-radius:5px;\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gold\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gold\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gold.png\" data-image-key=\"Gold.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/10/Gold.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20220824202442\" /></a></span> <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span class=\"Tsh(Game) C(Gold) game-font-face\"> Gold</span></strong></span></h2>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gold\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gold.png\" data-image-key=\"Gold.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/10/Gold.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20220824202442\" /></a></span> <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span class=\"Tsh(Game) C(Gold) game-font-face\"> Gold</span></strong> is the 2nd most important currency, as they allow the Player to purchase powerful items such as <a href=\"/wiki/Items\" title=\"Items\">XP Food</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Items\" title=\"Items\">Star Fruits</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Items\" title=\"Items\">Summon Tickets</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Items\" title=\"Items\">Raid Tickets</a>. You can also use Gold to create <a href=\"/wiki/Evolution\" title=\"Evolution\">Evolution Items</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Relics\" title=\"Relics\">Relics</a>. Gold can be earned through selling your Units, through <a href=\"/wiki/Events\" title=\"Events\">events</a>, and completing the Extra Gold Challenge. \n</p><p>In Update 10.7.5, you can now use gold to purchase more unit &amp; skin slots at the Bartender NPC for increasing amounts of gold.\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gold\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gold.png\" data-image-key=\"Gold.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/10/Gold.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20220824202442\" /></a></span> <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span class=\"Tsh(Game) C(Gold) game-font-face\">50,000 Gold</span></strong> for the first upgrade. (150 Slots)\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gold\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gold.png\" data-image-key=\"Gold.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/10/Gold.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20220824202442\" /></a></span> <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span class=\"Tsh(Game) C(Gold) game-font-face\">75,000 Gold</span></strong> for the second upgrade. (200 Slots)\n</p><p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gold\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gold.png\" data-image-key=\"Gold.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/1/10/Gold.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20220824202442\" /></a></span> <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span class=\"Tsh(Game) C(Gold) game-font-face\">100,000 Gold</span></strong> for the last upgrade. (250 Slots)\n</p>\n</div><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><div style=\"background: linear-gradient(0deg, #FB8E1D 0%, #FE82182f 2%, #FFCA2812 100%, transparent );padding: 4px 7px 12px;border-radius:5px;\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trophies\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Trophies\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Trophies.png\" data-image-key=\"Trophies.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/6/6b/Trophies.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20230130150309\" /></a></span> <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span class=\"Tsh(Game) C(Trophies) game-font-face\"> Trophies</span></strong></span></h2>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Trophies\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Trophies.png\" data-image-key=\"Trophies.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/6/6b/Trophies.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20230130150309\" /></a></span> <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span class=\"Tsh(Game) C(Trophies) game-font-face\"> Trophies</span></strong> is the currency that allows the Player to purchase Emotes.\n</p>\n</div><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div></div><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div><div class=\"wds-tab__content\"><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\">\n</p><p>There are also various limited time currencies that can only be obtained during certain time frames or events. There is currently <b>two</b> of these, The Stars and the Assassin Tokens\n</p>\n<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(0deg, #f5f080 0%, #646643 2%, #464528 100%, transparent); padding: 4px 7px 12px; border-radius: 5px;\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Assassin_Tokens\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/e/e0/Assassin_Token.png/revision/latest?cb=20250201210338\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Assassin Token\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"29\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Assassin Token.png\" data-image-key=\"Assassin_Token.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/e/e0/Assassin_Token.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20250201210338\" /></a></span>  Assassin Tokens</span></h2>\n<p><span class=\"new\" title=\"Template:Assassin Token (page does not exist)\" data-uncrawlable-url=\"L3dpa2kvVGVtcGxhdGU6QXNzYXNzaW5fVG9rZW4/YWN0aW9uPWVkaXQmcmVkbGluaz0x\">Template:Assassin Token</span> is a currency introduced as part of update 19.5.0, The <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log\" title=\"Update Log\">Sakamoto Days Update</a>. It was used to purchase <a href=\"/wiki/Summon\" title=\"Summon\">summons</a> at the Limited Time Assassin Event Banner and used for evolving limited units from this update.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(0deg, #8AA6FF 0%, #4D78FF1F 2%, #4D78FF17 100%, transparent); padding: 4px 7px 12px; border-radius: 5px;\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Stars\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/3/3c/Stars.png/revision/latest?cb=20221226140637\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Stars\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stars.png\" data-image-key=\"Stars.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/3/3c/Stars.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20221226140637\" /></a></span>  Stars</span></h2>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Stars\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Stars.png\" data-image-key=\"Stars.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/3/3c/Stars.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20221226140637\" /></a></span> <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Stars) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\"> Stars<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\"> Stars</span></span></strong> are commonly used for Christmas events, as they allow players to obtain skins or items that upgrade towers into different versions. Stars can be obtained by completing <a href=\"/wiki/Quests\" title=\"Quests\">Quests</a>, waves in Infinite Modes, and redeeming <a href=\"/wiki/Codes\" title=\"Codes\">Codes</a> and <a href=\"/wiki/Events\" title=\"Events\">events</a>.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(0deg, #ff6e2c 0%, #ff952c2e 2%, #ffcc2c12 100%, transparent );padding: 4px 7px 12px;border-radius:5px;\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Candies\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/df/Candies.png/revision/latest?cb=20221029003129\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Candies\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Candies.png\" data-image-key=\"Candies.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/df/Candies.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20221029003129\" /></a></span>  Candies</span></h2>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Candies\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Candies.png\" data-image-key=\"Candies.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/d/df/Candies.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20221029003129\" /></a></span> <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span class=\"Pos(r) Bg(Candies) Bgcp(text) Tfc(transparent) game-font-face\"> Candies<span class=\"Tsh(Game) Pos(a) Start(0) Z(-1)\"> Candies</span></span></strong>   are an event currency introduced as part of update 5.0. They are currently used to purchase XP food, capsules for character skins, Dungeon keys, and Evolution Items. Jewels can be earned by completing missions from the Mission Board and by selling Infused Crystals to the Mysterious Mage by the Dungeon entrance.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(0deg, #8AA6FF 0%, #4D78FF1F 2%, #4D78FF17 100%, transparent); padding: 4px 7px 12px; border-radius: 5px;\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Pearls\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/7/76/Pearls.png/revision/latest?cb=20230731061309\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Pearls\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Pearls.png\" data-image-key=\"Pearls.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/7/76/Pearls.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20230731061309\" /></a></span>  Pearls</span></h2>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Pearls\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Pearls.png\" data-image-key=\"Pearls.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/7/76/Pearls.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20230731061309\" /></a></span> <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span class=\"Tsh(Game) game-font-face\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(0deg, #a89bdd, #e9b9fe, #fffaa6, #e3a8fc 50%, transparent); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\"> Pearls</span></strong>   was commonly used for the Summer event, as they allowed players to buy the <a href=\"/wiki/Portals\" title=\"Portals\">Summer Portals</a> and buy Evolution Items for the Summer Units\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(0deg, #9B59B6 0%, #8E44AD4D 2%, #D7B2E81A 100%, transparent); padding: 4px 7px 12px; border-radius: 5px;\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Grief_Seeds\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/2/28/Grief_Seed.png/revision/latest?cb=20230603191651\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Grief Seed\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Grief Seed.png\" data-image-key=\"Grief_Seed.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/2/28/Grief_Seed.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20230603191651\" /></a></span>  Grief Seeds</span></h2>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Grief Seed\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"24\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Grief Seed.png\" data-image-key=\"Grief_Seed.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/2/28/Grief_Seed.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20230603191651\" /></a></span> <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span class=\"Tsh(Game) game-font-face\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(0deg, #6A0DAD, #A45DBB 50%, transparent); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\"> Grief Seeds</span></strong>   is a currency introduced as part of update 13.5, The <a href=\"/wiki/Update_Log\" title=\"Update Log\">Madoka Magica Update</a>. It was used to purchase <a href=\"/wiki/Summon\" title=\"Summon\">summons</a> at the Limited Time Madoka Magica Banner and used for buying Evolution Items.\n</p>\n</div>\n<div style=\"background: linear-gradient(0deg, #F21E0F 0%, #f21e0f1f 2%, #f86c2e1f 100%, transparent );padding: 4px 7px 12px;border-radius:5px;\">\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Gun_Devil_Bullet\"><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/7/76/Gun_Devil_Bullet.png/revision/latest?cb=20230118053037\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Gun Devil Bullet\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"30\" height=\"30\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gun Devil Bullet.png\" data-image-key=\"Gun_Devil_Bullet.png\" data-relevant=\"0\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/7/76/Gun_Devil_Bullet.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/30?cb=20230118053037\" /></a></span>  Gun Devil Bullet</span></h2>\n<p><span typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Currencies\" title=\"Currencies\"><img alt=\"Gun devil bullet\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"24\" height=\"18\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Gun devil bullet.png\" data-image-key=\"Gun_devil_bullet.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/animeadventures/images/b/b4/Gun_devil_bullet.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/24?cb=20230115005827\" /></a></span> <strong class=\"mw-selflink selflink\"><span class=\"Tsh(Game) game-font-face\" style=\"background: linear-gradient(0deg, #A6372B, #FF5C4D 50%, transparent); -webkit-background-clip: text; -webkit-text-fill-color: transparent;\"> Gun Devil Bullets</span></strong> is a currency that allows you to make purchases in the Makimo's store, and also for it you can evolve some units.\n</p>\n</div><p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p></div></div>\n\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20261023110642\nCache expiry: 2592000\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.057 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.081 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 153/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3187/2097152 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 19/2097152 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 5/100\nExpensive parser functi